        q("eng-comp-004","eng-comprehension-strategies","When a word is unfamiliar, the best first step is to:",listOf("Ignore the entire paragraph","Use the surrounding context","Choose the longest option","Assume its first dictionary meaning"),1,"Context, grammar and tone help determine the intended meaning."),
